  "prefLabel": "Lab 901.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2008-08-24",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 901.01 Purpose. The purposes of these rules are to define terms contained in RSA 275-E, to describe the form content and notices required to be posted by RSA 275-E:7, and to notify workers how to file a complaint for relief under the statute.\n\nSource. #4685, eff 12-09-88; EXPIRED 12-09-94\n\nNew. #7351, eff 8-24-00, EXPIRED: 8-24-08\n\nNew. #9257, eff 9-11-08; ss by #10522, eff 2-15-14; ss by #13731, eff 8-25-23",
